# Lychee ignore list — known false-positives or transient issues.
#
# Format: one URL pattern (regex) per line. See https://lychee.cli.rs/usage/config/
#
# Process for adding entries:
# 1. Run weekly link-audit workflow manually: gh workflow run link-audit.yml
# 2. Inspect the resulting issue; for each genuine false-positive (paywalls,
#    rate-limited but live, ephemeral 5xx) add a comment-justified entry below.
# 3. For genuine dead links, fix the source instead of suppressing here.

# --- Examples (delete these once a real entry replaces them) ---
# # Paywalled article that lychee can't authenticate
# # ^https://www\.thehindu\.com/.*$
#
# # Frequently rate-limited (429) but always live
# # ^https://www\.thelancet\.com/.*$

